{"ticker":"INTC","updated":"2026-11-13T23:35:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Intel Corporation","shortName":"Intel Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.intel.com","fullTimeEmployees":81100,"marketCap":317092888576,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":33.321045,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.2944117,"pegRatio":1.36,"targetMeanPrice":90.65116,"targetHighPrice":160.0,"targetLowPrice":63.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":43,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.209,"earningsGrowth":-0.327,"grossMargins":0.40152,"operatingMargins":0.10317001,"profitMargins":-0.20089,"totalRevenue":59891998720,"beta":2.426,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":142.35,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":32.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Intel Corporation designs, develops, manufactures, markets, sells, and services computing and related end products and services in the United States, Ireland, Israel, and internationally. It operates through three segments: CCG, DCAI, and Intel Foundry. The company offers client computing group products, including client and commercial CPUs, discrete client GPUs, edge computing, and connectivity products; data center and AI products, such as server CPUs, discrete GPUs, and networking products; and semiconductors comprising wafer fabrication, substrates, and other related products and services. It also provides driving assistance and self-driving solutions; and develops and manufactures multi-beam mask writing tools. The company sells its products through sales organizations, distributors, resellers, retailers, and OEM partners. It serves original equipment manufacturers, original design manufacturers, cloud service providers, and other manufacturers and service providers. Intel Corporation has a strategic collaboration with Infosys Limited to develop a multi-layer AI fabric that unifies infrastructure, models, data, applications, and workflows into a composable and agent-ready ecosystem. The company was incorporated in 1968 and is headquartered in Santa Clara, California.","summary_zh":"英特爾公司在美國、愛爾蘭、以色列和國際上設計、開發、製造、行銷、銷售計算及相關終端產品和服務並提供服務。它透過三個部門運作：CCG、DCAI 和英特爾代工廠。該公司提供客戶端運算組產品，包括客戶端和商用CPU、離散客戶端GPU、邊緣運算和連接產品；資料中心和人工智慧產品，例如伺服器CPU、獨立GPU和網路產品；以及半導體，包括晶圓製造、基板以及其他相關產品和服務。它還提供駕駛輔助和自動駕駛解決方案；並開發和製造多光束掩模寫入工具。該公司透過銷售組織、分銷商、經銷商、零售商和 OEM 合作夥伴銷售其產品。服務於原始設備製造商、原始設計製造商、雲端服務提供者以及其他製造商和服務提供者。英特爾公司與 Infosys Limited 進行策略合作，開發多層人工智慧結構，將基礎設施、模型、資料、應用程式和工作流程統一到可組合且代理程式就緒的生態系統中。該公司成立於 1968 年，總部位於加州聖克拉拉。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":24.33,"h":25.46,"l":24.22,"c":24.77,"v":83951600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":24.82,"h":25.34,"l":24.69,"c":25.27,"v":60336600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":25.08,"h":25.26,"l":24.45,"c":24.9,"v":63093700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":31.78,"h":32.38,"l":30.16,"c":30.57,"v":523908000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":30.38,"h":30.63,"l":29.33,"c":29.58,"v":225702900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":29.67,"h":30.1,"l":28.73,"c":28.76,"v":130314500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":28.99,"h":30.2,"l":28.82,"c":29.34,"v":126317900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":29.38,"h":31.7,"l":29.23,"c":31.22,"v":164458500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":31.61,"h":34.25,"l":31.21,"c":33.99,"v":295709300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":35.02,"h":36.3,"l":34.49,"c":35.5,"v":268583300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":34.52,"h":35.05,"l":33.73,"c":34.48,"v":152605900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":33.93,"h":34.24,"l":33.02,"c":33.55,"v":124818400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":33.53,"h":36.06,"l":33.5,"c":35.94,"v":162649700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":35.76,"h":37.57,"l":35.44,"c":37.3,"v":149361700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":37.95,"h":38.08,"l":36.45,"c":36.83,"v":125359300},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":37.19,"h":38.68,"l":36.43,"c":36.59,"v":112086100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":36.64,"h":38.05,"l":36.35,"c":37.17,"v":111140200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":36.55,"h":37.79,"l":35.91,"c":37.43,"v":103202100},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":37.53,"h":38.1,"l":36.86,"c":37.8,"v":89884700},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":38.46,"h":39.65,"l":36.3,"c":36.37